["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"3 new scandals show being a pain in the ass for AI labs is a legit job now | Rob Wiblin looped transformers chain of thought non-disparagement agreement federal preemption Not For Private Gain campaign\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-eightythousand-anthropic的法案让人几乎没法叫停危险的ai训练/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d70069c16841d26d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">29:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic的法案让人几乎没法叫停危险的AI训练</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">法案把叫停权压缩成商务部长签字、一家特区法院45天内拍板，模型真出事时几乎来不及按下刹车。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI监管</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"E208 A股又是大震荡，价值投资的实践、挑战和思考 | 永庆、David 对谈弘尚资产张骏\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-touzishizhan-亏钱不是a股的错-是你对它的认知不够/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/478f2b894977699e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"投\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">投资实战派</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>亏钱不是A股的错，是你对它的认知不够</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">张骏复盘今年60多的累计回撤后发现，A股牛短熊长、资金久期短的根源，从来不是市场本身，而是投资者对公司内在价值和宏观周期的认知跟不上变化的速度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">价值投资</span><span class=\"tag\">内在价值</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"老黄经济学：一口气看懂英伟达的商业帝国 Jevons Paradox DSXPORT Productive / Fungible / Durable circular financing ACIE\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-laoshi-下一财年-英伟达四分之一营收要靠自己给客户撑腰/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e1f942ceb55eb0d1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"老\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">老石谈芯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>下一财年，英伟达四分之一营收要靠自己给客户撑腰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英伟达一边把GPU包装成可融资资产，一边自掏腰包投资AI实验室、帮客户垫钱买自己的芯片，循环融资撑起营收，也让应收账款飙到631亿美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力经济</span><span class=\"tag\">循环融资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Roasting China&#x27;s AI Industry (中文版) benchmark RSI scaling law PMF\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-chinatalk-大模型是制造业不是魔法-谁都别想领先超过一个月/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ae93881f9f6bfed0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>大模型是制造业不是魔法：谁都别想领先超过一个月</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">丧钟AI的作者认为，大模型厂没有任何能保密的技术差异，数据和算力就是生产资料，这和光伏、手机、电动车的逻辑一样——谁的领先都撑不过一个月。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">国产大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">视频生成模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The company building America’s uranium supply from scratch HALEU SMR LCOE EPC cost-plus\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-cheekypint-美国核燃料断供倒计时-2028年前必须自己造出浓缩铀/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a5900de8bd0ec158-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">59:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cheeky Pint</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>美国核燃料断供倒计时：2028年前必须自己造出浓缩铀</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">冷战后美国放弃了自己的铀浓缩产能，转而靠进口俄罗斯核燃料；国会定下2028年禁令，General Matter要抢在那之前建成本土产能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">核能</span><span class=\"tag\">铀浓缩</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Andrew Huberman’s Three Rules for Better Health and Focus NSDR / Yoga Nidra N-acetylcysteine (NAC) sex hormone binding globulin P5P\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-a16z-创始人每天只有两段黄金专注期-被打断代价是指数级的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">49:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>创始人每天只有两段黄金专注期，被打断代价是指数级的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Huberman说普通人一天真正高效的专注窗口通常只有两三段，这段时间被无关的事打断，损失的不是那几个小时，而是指数级拖累整体产出。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">健康习惯</span><span class=\"tag\">力量训练</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"K.C. Irving: Competing with Giants vertical integration Combines Investigation Act succession duties equal opportunity\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-knowledge-政府想用遗产税拆散家族企业-他干脆移居百慕大保住控制权/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6d457e7b70836700-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:03:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Knowledge Project</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>政府想用遗产税拆散家族企业，他干脆移居百慕大保住控制权</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">凯西·欧文六十年只信一条规则——重要的东西必须自己掌控。当新税制第一次威胁到这份100%所有权时，他选择带着全部财产离开新不伦瑞克。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">家族企业</span><span class=\"tag\">纵向整合</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Remembering Noah Adams Transgenic Pets pivot point sprinkler\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-throughline-战争博物馆里挂满英雄照-却没有一张受害者/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">24:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>战争博物馆里挂满英雄照，却没有一张受害者</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">诺亚·亚当斯90年代在贝尔格莱德军事博物馆的观察：两小时展品从九世纪弓箭到二战坦克，全是英雄影像，没有一张受害者照片——战争因此被讲述成了常态。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">NPR</span><span class=\"tag\">口述历史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"513 为永明时代作传：林晓光谈南齐武帝萧赜与南朝文学的爆发 检籍 土断 黄籍/白籍 永明声律\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-cn2aa250-近体诗平仄格律-本质是贵族社会的等级礼仪搬进了诗歌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:35:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>近体诗平仄格律，本质是贵族社会的等级礼仪搬进了诗歌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">南齐永明年间发现汉语四声只是起点，真正让近体诗定型的是贵族社会要求人人恰如其分嵌入等级秩序这套逻辑——内容平庸也算诗，平仄不合就不算诗。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">南北朝</span><span class=\"tag\">贵族社会</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"An Election Day Special With Nate Silver dummymander elasticity digital twin generic ballot\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-oddlots-民调不是在低估共和党-而是在怕错而过度修正/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">42:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>民调不是在低估共和党，而是在怕错而过度修正</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">缅因州一份民调把民主党原始9个点的领先，硬是用「可能投票模型」压成2个点——Nate Silver说这不是技术失误，是民调机构怕重蹈2016年低估特朗普覆辙后的自我保护。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国政治</span><span class=\"tag\">民调方法论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Q&amp;A: How to know if my child may have depression? internalizing issue externalizing warm handoff genetic loading\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-secureattach-四岁孩子反复说自己难过长达数月-值得认真对待/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">24:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>四岁孩子反复说自己难过长达数月，值得认真对待</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一个四岁男孩连续数月说自己难过却说不清原因，心理学家认为这已够格去做专业评估——幼儿抑郁罕见但确实存在，而且可以治疗。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">儿童心理</span><span class=\"tag\">幼儿抑郁</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Ep 226 Glanders: Straight from the horse’s mouth Burkholderia mallei Burkholderia pseudomallei Farcy Tier 1 select agent Koch&#x27;s postulates\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-tpwky-鼻疽至今没有疫苗-防控唯一办法就是扑杀所有感染动物/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>鼻疽至今没有疫苗，防控唯一办法就是扑杀所有感染动物</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这种专性寄生在马属动物体内的细菌致死率超过90%，对抗生素天生耐药，人类研究了一百多年，唯一拿得出手的办法还是「发现就杀」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">传染病</span><span class=\"tag\">兽医史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"296: Avoidance Feeds Anxiety: When to Make Teens Do Hard Things | Dr. Meredith Elkins exposure-based therapy accommodation SPACE program\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-asklisa-父母越是心疼着接送孩子逃避-焦虑就越难治好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bc857b2c3fda762e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">43:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>父母越是心疼着接送孩子逃避，焦虑就越难治好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">回避带来的轻松会让大脑记住「这件事我搞不定」,下次更想逃；真正管用的办法是分级直面让自己不舒服的事，这套框架对轻度紧张和临床焦虑症同样有效。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">儿童心理</span><span class=\"tag\">焦虑障碍</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"When Toddlers Resist Absolutely Everything the untethered twos\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-unruffled-两岁娃的疯狂抵抗不是亲子关系出问题-而是情绪在自愈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">30:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>两岁娃的疯狂抵抗不是亲子关系出问题，而是情绪在自愈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">两岁孩子对上车、洗澡、牵手过马路样样说不，是因为经历巨变却毫无掌控感，这时该做的不是给更多选择，而是把边界收得更早更紧。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育儿</span><span class=\"tag\">两岁儿童</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"“You’re Too Sensitive” Isn’t Helpful — Here’s What Is, with Dr. Sasha Hamdani RSD (Rejection Sensitive Dysphoria) amygdala prefrontal cortex DFK (deeply feeling kids) emotional vaccination\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-03-goodinside-怕被拒绝不是矫情-杏仁核过度警觉-前额叶跟不上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5be2ae9a80276893-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">49:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Good Inside</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>怕被拒绝不是矫情：杏仁核过度警觉，前额叶跟不上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">心理医生 Sasha Hamdani 说：被拒绝的恐惧不是性格问题，而是杏仁核过度警觉、前额叶反应不足导致的真实神经反应，道理劝不醒它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">ADHD</span><span class=\"tag\">拒绝敏感性烦躁症</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Building Legal Agents When You Can&#x27;t See the Data - Jacob Lauritzen, CTO of Legora Tabular Review Forward Deployed Engineer Legal Engineer Pareto frontier DPA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-latentspace-法律ai最大的工程难题不是模型-是永远看不到真实数据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/927785d01eabb481-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>法律AI最大的工程难题不是模型，是永远看不到真实数据</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">客户数据大多连律所自己都无权查看，Legora的evals团队只能靠分类和改写后的合成数据，去猜测律师们真实在做什么。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法律科技</span><span class=\"tag\">企业AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Robots Already Working in American Factories | Tutor Intelligence teleoperator / tutor greenfield market HRI(Human-Robot Interaction) action diffusion transformer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-a16z-机器人创业公司不卖ai-只卖-时薪16美元-这句话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">46:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>机器人创业公司不卖AI,只卖「时薪16美元」这句话</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tutor向从未买过机器人的工厂主推销时，从不提模型和AI,只说一个数字——时薪16美元的机器人；这背后是美国一年仅部署3.8万台工业机器人、九成工厂空白的现实。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">机器人</span><span class=\"tag\">制造业自动化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Onion Futures Act corner long position short position open interest\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-stuffmissed-两个农民囤光洋葱操纵期货-让国会专门立法禁掉了洋葱期货/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>两个农民囤光洋葱操纵期货，让国会专门立法禁掉了洋葱期货</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">两人联手买下芝加哥几乎全部洋葱、逼经销商签秘密协议，又反手做空把价格砸到历史最低，国会因此专门立法永久禁止洋葱做期货交易。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">期货监管</span><span class=\"tag\">市场操纵</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"373 | Colin Camerer on the Neuroscience of Economic Thinking mentalizing cognitive hierarchy model / level-k framing effect burstiness (Poisson non-homogeneity) Neural Autopilot model neural gaslighting\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-mindscape-科学家让大鼠的大脑-骗-自己盐水很好喝/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d69097efcbd03611-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Mindscape</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>科学家让大鼠的大脑「骗」自己盐水很好喝</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究者用光遗传学上调大鼠脑内编码奖励信号的神经元，让它喝到讨厌的盐水时，大脑仍判定「这次很好」——感官与奖励信号可以被直接割裂。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">行为经济学</span><span class=\"tag\">神经经济学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The $300 Billion Structured Notes Market Is Booming Vega Gamma Auto-callable Worst-of Knock-in / Knock-out Uridashi\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-oddlots-3000亿美元结构票据市场-正在悄悄放大美股下跌的力道/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">51:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>3000亿美元结构票据市场，正在悄悄放大美股下跌的力道</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">标普、纳指、罗素挂钩的「表现最差者」自动赎回票据一旦不再按时敲出，交易商被迫同时抛售更多波动率敞口，而愿意接盘的做市商却在收缩。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">结构票据</span><span class=\"tag\">衍生品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Airbnb CEO Brian Chesky: “I Was a Great Founder and a Terrible CEO” founder mode skip level\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-howibuilt-airbnb能活下来-是因为商业模式好到掩盖了管理混乱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c49ad29f2140d349-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">How I Built This</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>Airbnb能活下来，是因为商业模式好到掩盖了管理混乱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他说Airbnb商业模式好到能掩盖管理混乱，直到疫情把公司逼到生死关头，他才被迫从放权转向事必躬亲的创始人模式。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">领导力</span><span class=\"tag\">创始人模式</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"20VC: Who Wins the Inference Market | Has Open-Source LLM Inference Peaked? | What Happens to the Cost of Compute | The Real Limits of Post-Training and RL with Erik Bernhardsson, Modal CEO NeoCloud PLG (Product-Led Growth) sandbox\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-twentyvc-ai推理不再有90-毛利-每多一层供应商就分走利润/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/039f47c822a2df13-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">20VC</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>AI推理不再有90%毛利，每多一层供应商就分走利润</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一美元从客户流到英伟达手里，要经过应用、模型、基础设施、云等好几层，每层都切走20%到30%的毛利，这就是AI基础设施公司回不到软件黄金时代毛利率的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI推理</span><span class=\"tag\">GPU算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Rise of Peter The Great Streltsi Grand Embassy knout fiscal-military state\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-historyhit-彼得大帝西游归来-只搬技术-绝口不提议会与自由/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9e331afa96f76fb1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">47:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>彼得大帝西游归来：只搬技术，绝口不提议会与自由</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他访问了光荣革命后的英国和共和制的荷兰，带回的只有造船术、刮胡刀新规和炮台图纸，议会与政治自由被原样留在了西欧。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">俄国历史</span><span class=\"tag\">彼得大帝</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Episode Summary 13: What Is Neuroaffirming ADHD Support? A Counselor Explains neuroaffirming interest-based nervous system MCAS Ehlers-Danlos syndrome executive function\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-parentmojo-adhd不是自控力缺陷-而是神经系统处理世界的方式不同/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">29:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>ADHD不是自控力缺陷，而是神经系统处理世界的方式不同</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">主流框架把ADHD当作执行功能缺陷、靠自控力纠正；这位心理咨询师认为根源是注意力调节和感官系统天生不同，这套神经系统曾是人类赖以生存的优势。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">ADHD</span><span class=\"tag\">神经多样性</span>\n</div></div></a>"]